                                                "sense_id": "84202b40-9007-36e4-a702-e2f2c2bc27e2",
                                                "text": "A perfect example is life insurance. Most people starting out don't need it; you should only insure what you can't afford to lose or replace, and singles or young marrieds without a lot of assets frequently don't require coverage."
